{"data":[{"author_id":"42308076","created_at":"2026-06-07T01:48:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2063438016858018126"],"id":"2063438016858018126","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":100109,"like_count":68,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":84,"retweet_count":1},"text":"翻了我原来的账号，整整2200多条推文，我做了3年，积累了23w粉丝，视如己出，很多人都说我的推文有活人感，那是因为我真的在写我的生活我的经历，被封的这几天我总是睡觉的时候惊醒！不敢相信这是真的","url":"https://x.com/mazziniunsaya/status/2063438016858018126"},{"author_id":"42308076","created_at":"2026-06-06T05:39:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2063133689064952279"],"id":"2063133689064952279","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":16,"impression_count":90949,"like_count":91,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":3},"text":"北电的主任以上级别，一年到底是姑娘睡到腿软，钞票收到手软，我的人生第一课就是陪学校领导睡的\n\n              （节选原推文2025/9/29）","url":"https://x.com/mazziniunsaya/status/2063133689064952279"},{"author_id":"42308076","created_at":"2026-06-05T06:39:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2062786269705576850"],"id":"2062786269705576850","in_reply_to_user_id":"42308076","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":67712,"like_count":29,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2062784917550084399","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"我说过很多名人，说过很多绯闻，都ok，但是只是说了一句币安限制了我出金，我本意是沟通，不知道他们这么弄我","url":"https://x.com/mazziniunsaya/status/2062786269705576850"},{"author_id":"42308076","created_at":"2026-06-05T06:33:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2062784917550084399"],"id":"2062784917550084399","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":11,"impression_count":111908,"like_count":39,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":3},"text":"我相信很多人都刷到过我23w的大号，但是他不幸的死掉了，我最后一条推文是指出了币安出金限制我80wu的提款，当时也有专员联系我，说下周一就能给你准确回复，可等来的是下周一我的23w粉账号死掉了，我这才知道币安维护舆情是这么简单粗暴，搞死你的账号，时至今天我钱也没取到，账号也消失@binancezh https://t.co/LF8fcsVJJL","url":"https://x.com/mazziniunsaya/status/2062784917550084399"},{"author_id":"42308076","created_at":"2026-06-02T13:39:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["20618049331718271